# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Workspace-level ignores.
#
# Everything genuinely heavy in this project lives outside the tree already:
# run trees, conda envs, the AtomBench checkout and the prepared datasets are
# all under $CSP_RUNS / $TRAIN_ENV / $ATOMBENCH_REPO (see either harness's
# own env.sh).  Nothing here needs to exclude them; they were never in the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Scheduler droppings, if anything is ever launched from the workspace root.
slurm-*.out
*.err

# Written by install.sh: this machine's paths and (once filled in) its
# scheduler settings.  Site-local by construction -- committing it would
# make one cluster's paths the default for every future clone.
/site.env
/datasets

# Hugging Face staging (hardlinks into the DVC-tracked tiers, rebuilt by
# tools/write_metadata.py); only the cards are tracked.
/hf/model/
/hf/datasets/
# A DVC remote fetched from the Hub by tools/hf_sync.sh pull.
/.dvc-remote/
# The tooling venv, if someone builds it in-tree.
/.tools/
